ፃ ማሂ","poem":1},{"text":"ዔያቶ ኔኤኒ ዶኦሬኔ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ቢያ ባኮ ዔያታ ዎይሣንዳጉዲ ኔኤኒ ማሄኔ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"ማራቶንታ ባኣቶንታ፥ ካዮ ቦዖዋ ዓይሱዋዖ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ጫሪንጮ ካፖንታ ባዞ ሞላሢንታ","poem":1},{"text":"ባዞ ዋኣፆ ዴማ ናንጋ ባኮ ቢያ","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ዔያታ ዎይሣንዳጉዲ ኔኤኒ ማሄኔ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳ ማዔ ኑ ፆኦዛሢዮ!","poem":1},{"text":"ሱንፃ ኔኤኮ ሳዖ ቢያይዳ ዼኤፒ ዔርቴያኬ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/mdy_twf/PSA/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/mdy_twf/PSA/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/mdy_twf/PSA/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}